WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.531 --> 00:00:01.590
- Welcome back, y'all.

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.320
Our next guest is a super
talent singer/songwriter

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.230
whose latest album is an
ode to these autumn months

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.750
when the leaves are turning
and change is in the air,

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.180
especially in his hometown in New England.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.820
That album is called Stick
Season, and it's out now.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.790
Joining us amid his
sold-out nationwide tour,

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:19.230
performing "Northern Attitude,"

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.295
give it up for Noah Kahan.

